diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index db5a398..3fa6b37 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,16 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Command line
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar <command> [options]
+
+Run without arguments to list all commands, or add `-help` to a command for its options. Main commands:
+* `init` - creates a new analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports` - generates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape` - creates or refreshes a landscape report aggregating the analyses found under `-analysisRoot` (`<root>/_sokrates_landscape`); `updateLandscape` is the older name of the same command and is still supported
+* `updateConfig` - updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+
 ### Docker
 
